  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ISK-granskning War Child Sweden</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Internal Control Review of War Child Sverige - Internal Control Review of War Child</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">During the spring of 2025, Sida launched a call for proposal for Swedish civil society organisations for project support between 1 and 5 M SEK per year. Insamlingsstiftelsen War Child (War Child Sweden) has submitted an application which is currently undergoing review by Sida. Since Sida need more information about the internal control of War Child Sweden, a decision has been taken to contract a consultant to perform an assessment based on these terms of reference.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Under v&#xE5;ren 2025 utlyste Sida projektst&#xF6;d p&#xE5; mellan 1 och 5 miljoner kronor per &#xE5;r till svenska civilsamh&#xE4;llesorganisationer. Insamlingsstiftelsen War Child (War Child Sverige) har l&#xE4;mnat in en ans&#xF6;kan som f&#xF6;r n&#xE4;rvarande granskas av Sida. Eftersom Sida beh&#xF6;ver mer information om organisationens interna kapacitet anlitar Sida konsultst&#xF6;d. Detta avropas p&#xE5; rangordnat ramavtal.</narrative>
  </description>
